Z||000035||FieroJoe||11-27-2001||02:05 PM||||Boy, I sure was late in posting to this thread!  Anyways, chalk up one more for the Michigan Fiero count.  I know that there are a lot more than this too, judging by the fact that there were over 100 very very nice Fieros at the MFC Annual show this summer, and I only saw/met a small handful of PFF members.<P>Alot of them, though, were much older than me and my friends (Fieromaster88, StansGT, MooCow, jch82, Black86SE, Tigger) and from those who I talked to, they weren't very interested in online stuff.  Oh well, their loss!<P>By the way, while we're in this thread, how many of you are actually in the MFC?  Brent, you are correct?  I was thinking about joining, but we've got our own club that's a lot more active, and we're all friends!<P>We should plan for a big show and shine in the beginning of the summer.  Just a big get together!  We've gotten together at Frances Park in Lansing before, but I think that it might be too small for anything larger<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
